The data files in this directory (hardness.csv, oxidation.csv, and
source_tables.json) are transcribed from:

  C. Dinesh Chandra, B. Rushikesh, Mohammed Numan, and B. Venkatesh,
  "Experimental Studies of Stellite-6 Hardfaced Layer on Ferrous Materials by
  TIG Surfacing Process," IOP Conference Series: Materials Science and
  Engineering 998 (2020) 012061.
  https://doi.org/10.1088/1757-899X/998/1/012061

The source article is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
Unported License (CC BY 3.0):

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

The transcribed tables and source-value notes in this directory are distributed
under the same license. You must give appropriate credit to the original authors,
provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made.

The project's source code is licensed separately under the MIT License; see the
LICENSE file in the repository root.

The project does not claim ownership of the experimental measurements. It
preserves the printed values and records unresolved unit, sign, and provenance
questions in data/README.md and docs/SOURCE_AUDIT.md.
